Z||000016||Tigger||02-21-2001||04:10 PM||||Things to see while in Toney Alabama?<P>You are in luck!  The Fiero Factory is in Toney Alabama!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>Right now the first thing that pops into mind is Talledega Superspeedway.  Not sure if they have a track museum and not sure how far that's from Toney?  Just an idea...||||reg||3
Z||000017||PAUL88GT||02-22-2001||10:05 AM||||87:<BR>Your car was still in the lot. It did not appear as though they had started on it yet. It looked sharp by the way, very sporty. The 3.4 I saw was going into a green coupe. 3/24 would be OK. <P>bhooper: Deliverance was filmed in North Georgia.<P>JohnnyK: I will not even waste my time responding to your comments. The rednecks that live in Hunsville (near Toney) put a man on the moon in 1969 and have designed and built almost every major element of the Space Shuttle and International Space Station.<P>Tigger: Talledega is about 2 hours south of the Fiero Factory. They do have a museum. <P>Paul<P><p>[This message has been edited by PAUL88GT (edited 02-22-2001).]||||reg||1
